    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPrime location on a large private site - a stone's throw from Abbeyside beach & boardwalk!Situated in one of the most popular and sought after areas in Abbeyside, this 3 bedroom bungalow is a stroll from everything the area has to offer and is securely enclosed by block walls and entrance gates. The property is within walking distance of Dungarvan town centre and just a stone's throw from the Waterford Greenway cycle track and Abbeyside beach and boardwalk.Inside, the house is well laid out with the living room located to the front. This is a bright and spacious room with an open fireplace that creates a real feeling of warmth and relaxation. All 3 bedrooms are off the hallway and are of ample size with a shower room servicing them. The extended kitchen/dining room is quite spacious with plenty of countertop space and ample room for dining. A door opens to a rear yards that allows a vehicle to the rear.Externally, the property has enclosed gardens and a tarmac driveway to the front and rear, perfect for safe play as well as a detached block-built garage nestled to the side at the rear. This property would make the perfect family or retirement home and has space for further extension subject to planning."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Very sought after location. </li><li>Large private site with front and rear enclosed gardens.</li><li>Walking distance to Dungarvan town centre and all amenities and only a short stroll to Abbeyside boardwalk and beach. </li><li>Around the corner from the Greenway.</li><li>Spacious living room and extended kitchen/dining.</li><li>Detached block built garage - 20' x 12'.</li><li>Commuting distance to Waterford, Clonmel and Cork. </li><li>Ample secure car parking to the front and rear of the property. </li><li>Mains services.</li><li>Oil fired central heating.</ul>"
      },
      {
